WEBVTT

00:06.500 --> 00:08.920
[♪ epic choral music playing]

00:13.430 --> 00:15.680
[narrator] <i>The True Demon King has died.</i>

00:15.760 --> 00:17.510
[crackling]

00:17.600 --> 00:21.060
<i>The enemy of the world</i>
<i>that filled the horizon with fear,</i>

00:21.140 --> 00:22.930
<i>was defeated by somebody.</i>

00:23.310 --> 00:25.440
<i>To this very day,</i>

00:25.810 --> 00:28.770
<i>that lone Hero remains unknown,</i>
<i>both in name and existence.</i>

00:29.150 --> 00:31.940
<i>Now the age of fear has come to an end,</i>

00:32.320 --> 00:35.610
<i>that person has to be chosen.</i>

00:38.620 --> 00:40.700
[♪ theme music playing]

00:50.670 --> 00:53.880
ISHURA

02:08.040 --> 02:10.920
New Principality of Lithia

02:12.540 --> 02:15.460
[narrator]
<i>A general named Taren the Guarded,</i>

02:15.550 --> 02:19.470
<i>has broken away from Aureatia,</i>
<i>the only minian kingdom.</i>

02:19.550 --> 02:21.970
[♪ gentle, bright music playing]

02:22.550 --> 02:23.810
-[child] Wait up!
-[laughter]

02:24.930 --> 02:27.230
[narrator] <i>Taren has declared independence</i>

02:27.310 --> 02:30.480
<i>for the regional city along the canal</i>
<i>that she possessed,</i>

02:30.980 --> 02:33.610
<i>and is calling it</i>
<i>the New Principality of Lithia.</i>

02:34.360 --> 02:38.110
<i>This was also</i>
<i>a serious military provocation</i>

02:38.700 --> 02:41.990
<i>that threatened</i>
<i>Aureatia's control over the frontier.</i>

02:42.070 --> 02:45.990
Episode 2
Alus the Star Runner

02:46.080 --> 02:49.000
Lithia Territory
Main Highway

02:49.580 --> 02:52.250
[narrator] <i>That day, Lana the Moon Tempest</i>

02:52.330 --> 02:57.840
<i>was scheduled to return to Lithia</i>
<i>after being dispatched as a spy by Taren.</i>

02:58.340 --> 03:00.260
[horses galloping]

03:00.340 --> 03:03.010
Minia
Lana the Moon Tempest

03:03.600 --> 03:05.100
[Lana] They're getting closer.

03:05.600 --> 03:06.680
[growling]

03:06.760 --> 03:11.520
They attack in swarms like that
when they move in on a group of minians.

03:11.900 --> 03:13.650
Yep, they're wyverns all right.

03:14.610 --> 03:16.650
At this speed, they're bound to catch up.

03:17.280 --> 03:20.110
Won't we reach Lithia
before the wyverns catch up?

03:20.200 --> 03:22.450
[coachman] Not a chance
if you can see the swarm already.

03:22.530 --> 03:25.580
[Lana] But we're virtually there already.
Get a move on.

03:25.660 --> 03:27.290
[coachman] I'm going as fast as I can.

03:27.790 --> 03:29.700
[skeleton] We might all get eaten.

03:30.500 --> 03:32.540
[♪ mysterious music playing]

03:32.620 --> 03:36.210
Those of us who still have flesh, I mean.

03:36.290 --> 03:37.300
[soft gasp]

03:38.130 --> 03:40.050
Higuare, are you feeling confident?

03:40.130 --> 03:41.470
[roots crinkling]

03:42.760 --> 03:43.760
[Higuare] Yes.

03:43.840 --> 03:46.930
I can eliminate them all, of course.

03:47.430 --> 03:51.600
I heard Master Taren
is the self-proclaimed Demon King.

03:52.190 --> 03:55.100
That's just a nickname
the kingdom gave her.

03:55.190 --> 03:59.610
[Higuare] I understand that minian society
is ruled by three kingdoms.

03:59.690 --> 04:02.150
[scoffs]
I guess remote regions don't keep up.

04:02.240 --> 04:05.240
Now it's just Aureatia.
The other kingdoms all perished.

04:06.160 --> 04:07.990
Because of the True Demon King.

04:08.620 --> 04:12.500
[Lana] So for Aureatia,
they are the only One True King,

04:12.580 --> 04:14.750
and all others are just
self-proclaimed Demon Kings.

04:14.830 --> 04:18.630
[Higuare] Was the True Demon King
not also self-proclaimed?

04:19.210 --> 04:21.510
That one… was the real deal.

04:22.010 --> 04:25.130
Only the True Demon King
can be called a Demon King.

04:25.800 --> 04:28.390
-So your name is Higuare, huh?
-[Higuare] Yes.

04:29.010 --> 04:32.100
[skeleton] Even a visitor
would be more knowledgeable than you.

04:32.180 --> 04:34.390
And to think
you're in the mercenary business.

04:34.480 --> 04:35.850
[Higuare] For reasons of my own,

04:35.940 --> 04:38.770
I've lived a life
dedicated solely to wielding my blade.

04:38.860 --> 04:41.610
Higuare the Pelagic.

04:41.690 --> 04:44.530
That's what people call me. And yourself?

04:45.660 --> 04:47.070
Shalk the Sound Slicer.

04:49.030 --> 04:51.660
[Lana] Whatever, just get along, you two.

04:52.370 --> 04:54.660
If you two kill each other
before we arrive,

04:54.750 --> 04:56.040
what would Master Taren say--

04:56.120 --> 04:57.210
[Higuare] Lady Lana,

04:57.290 --> 05:00.340
it seems wyverns aren't
the only things approaching.

05:00.420 --> 05:02.130
-What?
-[rifle fires]

05:02.210 --> 05:03.340
[horse whinnies]

05:03.510 --> 05:05.090
[outlaw 1 chuckles]

05:05.170 --> 05:06.630
-[outlaw 1] Stop your wagon!
-[coachman whimpers]

05:06.720 --> 05:09.220
[outlaw 2] Resist and we'll kill you.
Hand over your cargo!

05:10.560 --> 05:12.100
Outlaws after our cargo.

05:12.180 --> 05:14.270
[Shalk] First wyverns, now outlaws.

05:14.350 --> 05:16.190
-We're completely boxed in.
-[rumbling]

05:16.270 --> 05:17.600
-[horse whinnies]
-[Lana grunts]

05:20.400 --> 05:21.440
-[coachman yelps]
-[horses whimpering]

05:22.030 --> 05:23.780
[outlaw 1]
Stop now or we'll blow you away.

05:23.860 --> 05:24.990
-Oy.
-[outlaw 2] Got it.

05:25.070 --> 05:26.280
[rifle cocks]

05:27.240 --> 05:28.280
[outlaw 2 chuckles]

05:28.360 --> 05:29.370
[Higuare] Above you.

05:30.120 --> 05:31.330
-[outlaw 2 grunts]
-[wyvern screeches]

05:32.290 --> 05:33.290
[outlaw 1] Huh?

05:33.370 --> 05:35.710
-[growling]
-[outlaw 2 screaming]

05:38.330 --> 05:40.250
-[outlaw 2 screaming in agony]
-[flesh squelching]

05:40.340 --> 05:43.130
[outlaw 1 whimpers]
Why are the wyverns here already?

05:43.210 --> 05:46.630
-When did they get here?
-[outlaw 3] How fast are they? Shoot!

05:46.720 --> 05:47.930
[both whimper]

05:48.510 --> 05:50.220
[outlaw 4] N-No way.

05:50.890 --> 05:53.010
They're coming from the city!

05:54.350 --> 05:55.680
[Lana] You can relax.

05:55.770 --> 05:57.100
You're not needed.

05:57.190 --> 06:00.440
Surely the minians haven't tamed them?

06:00.520 --> 06:01.810
[scoffs]

06:01.900 --> 06:03.020
Perhaps they have.

06:03.520 --> 06:05.320
[♪ intense music playing]

06:10.280 --> 06:13.080
[outlaw 1] Quit dawdling! Fire!

06:13.160 --> 06:15.410
[outlaw 3]
We never practiced firing up in the sky.

06:15.500 --> 06:17.210
-[thwacks]
-[outlaw 3 gasps in horror]

06:17.290 --> 06:19.710
[outlaw 4 grunts]
We're never going to hit them.

06:19.790 --> 06:21.290
-[outlaws screaming]
-[rifle firing]

06:21.380 --> 06:23.040
[outlaw 5] Stop!

06:23.130 --> 06:24.880
[outlaw 6] Help!

06:24.960 --> 06:25.960
[flesh squelching]

06:28.630 --> 06:29.880
[growls]

06:29.970 --> 06:33.680
All dead. All shooters are dead.

06:34.260 --> 06:36.470
[wyvern] Squad Two,
fly to the other side of the hill.

06:36.560 --> 06:38.680
You are not to eat minian flesh.

06:38.770 --> 06:41.060
Slash them all to bits!

06:41.310 --> 06:45.440
So everyone knows what happens to fools
who go against the New Principality!

06:46.030 --> 06:48.440
[scoffs]
Look at that swarm of wild trash.

06:49.200 --> 06:51.740
Attack! Prepare for aerial combat!

06:51.820 --> 06:53.950
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

06:54.660 --> 06:56.240
[all roaring]

06:57.330 --> 06:58.660
[all roaring]

07:00.040 --> 07:01.670
[all clamoring]

07:03.130 --> 07:04.960
[all groaning]

07:07.590 --> 07:09.340
[growling]

07:09.880 --> 07:10.880
[roars]

07:14.100 --> 07:17.470
[beam blazing]

07:27.400 --> 07:28.990
[Lana] That was Regnejee's Thermal Arts.

07:29.570 --> 07:32.070
[Higuare] Is Lord Regnejee a wyvern?

07:32.160 --> 07:36.160
Yeah. Every wyvern swarms with a leader.

07:36.240 --> 07:37.740
Regnejee is that leader.

07:37.830 --> 07:40.620
As long as they're on guard,
the New Principality--

07:40.710 --> 07:42.750
-[explosion]
-[rumbling]

07:43.370 --> 07:44.880
…is well protected.

07:45.290 --> 07:48.210
No other city in history
has utilized the wyverns

07:48.300 --> 07:49.510
for aerial warfare.

07:50.090 --> 07:51.260
[Lana] They're invincible.

07:51.340 --> 07:53.760
Then why did the outlaws attack?

07:53.840 --> 07:55.180
What?

07:55.260 --> 07:58.680
[Shalk] The outlaws wouldn't have attacked
if they really were invincible.

07:58.760 --> 07:59.770
Right.

08:00.350 --> 08:03.270
And that's why you two are necessary.

08:03.850 --> 08:05.770
You mean they're not the real enemy?

08:05.860 --> 08:06.860
[Lana] Exactly.

08:06.940 --> 08:09.230
There's somebody directing the outlaws.

08:09.320 --> 08:13.360
Someone who stands to profit
by having them attack Lithia.

08:13.860 --> 08:15.910
[Higuare]
Don't they call Master Taren of Lithia

08:15.990 --> 08:18.280
a self-proclaimed Demon King?

08:19.620 --> 08:20.950
[Shalk] I see.

08:21.040 --> 08:23.080
So Aureatia is our opponent?

08:23.870 --> 08:26.290
Aureatia

08:26.380 --> 08:29.550
[narrator] <i>Aureatia, the city</i>
<i>that is ruled by the last Minian Queen.</i>

08:30.130 --> 08:32.800
<i>The politics of the city</i>

08:32.880 --> 08:36.590
<i>are not steered by the Queen,</i>
<i>but by Twenty-Nine Officials.</i>

08:37.640 --> 08:38.930
[chomps]

08:41.850 --> 08:43.940
I heard about Lithia.

08:44.020 --> 08:48.270
[official 1] Obviously, trade attacks
by outlaws won't be enough.

08:48.360 --> 08:50.440
We're dealing with Taren the Guarded.

08:51.610 --> 08:53.950
That's why we're having this discussion.

08:54.950 --> 08:58.370
[official 2] The Imperial Competition
to decide the Hero is a major undertaking.

08:58.950 --> 09:02.950
Should Lithia engage in an all-out attack,
we won't have the means to deal with it.

09:03.040 --> 09:04.750
And he knows it.

09:05.460 --> 09:09.250
Even so, war should only be
a very last resort.

09:09.880 --> 09:11.340
[official 1] So what you propose…

09:13.460 --> 09:15.010
is an assassination.

09:15.590 --> 09:16.590
Is it possible?

09:16.680 --> 09:19.720
[official 1] What about
the Seventeenth Minister… Elea's squad?

09:19.800 --> 09:21.510
I have a spy there.

09:22.100 --> 09:24.680
Though they are currently investigating
something else.

09:24.770 --> 09:26.440
As for suppressing the wyvern,

09:26.520 --> 09:28.980
that should be
the Sixth General's area of expertise.

09:29.060 --> 09:32.190
I'd prefer to keep old man Harghent
out of this.

09:32.530 --> 09:33.570
Agreed.

09:33.650 --> 09:37.660
Besides, he's currently headed
to Tileet Ravine to subdue a dragon.

09:37.740 --> 09:39.030
[official 1] A dragon?

09:39.120 --> 09:42.410
He's got no chance.
Just how far does he plan to fall?

09:43.040 --> 09:48.040
So, can I use who I please?
As long as nothing leads back to Aureatia.

09:48.960 --> 09:50.590
[official 2] Who do you plan to use?

09:50.880 --> 09:54.050
[official 1] An assassination
doesn't always have to be done quietly.

09:54.630 --> 09:57.760
-People sometimes die in huge accidents.
-[♪ tense music playing]

09:57.840 --> 09:59.430
[fire crackling]

10:00.300 --> 10:01.430
[official 2] A huge accident?

10:02.220 --> 10:03.310
[official 1 scoffs]

10:06.230 --> 10:08.850
[official 1] <i>Can you get</i>
<i>the Vortical Stampede released?</i>

10:10.020 --> 10:13.940
Ishura
Wyvern

10:14.030 --> 10:16.940
Tileet Ravine

10:18.530 --> 10:19.910
[horses plodding]

10:21.700 --> 10:23.700
[horses whinnying]

10:23.780 --> 10:26.700
Dragon Hunting Squad
Encampment

10:29.540 --> 10:30.960
You seem weary,

10:31.040 --> 10:32.380
Your Excellency.

10:33.040 --> 10:34.050
Hmm?

10:34.460 --> 10:36.670
Oh, Peke?

10:37.670 --> 10:39.550
[Peke] It seemed you were nodding off.

10:40.050 --> 10:42.140
[general] The march has taken 20 days.

10:42.220 --> 10:44.930
We even set up camp in some poorhouse.

10:45.260 --> 10:47.100
Anyone would be weary.

10:50.060 --> 10:51.650
What about the tracking unit?

10:51.730 --> 10:54.860
I've divided the radzio soldiers
into three groups and positioned them.

10:57.070 --> 10:59.360
[Peke] <i>I've got two people</i>
<i>patrolling above the valley at all times.</i>

10:59.450 --> 11:01.200
<i>One of them is a receiver.</i>

11:02.620 --> 11:06.120
From tomorrow, make it three per shift,
rotating every half day and night.

11:06.200 --> 11:07.330
[Peke] Yes, sir.

11:07.910 --> 11:10.410
But is the Smoldering one really injured?

11:11.420 --> 11:13.670
[general] We wouldn't be here
if we didn't know for sure.

11:13.750 --> 11:17.340
You'd normally see him soaring the sky,
but he's hiding away in his nest.

11:18.800 --> 11:19.970
It's our chance.

11:20.050 --> 11:23.720
[general] <i>The nightmare of Tileet Ravine,</i>
<i>Vikeon the Smoldering.</i>

11:23.800 --> 11:27.470
<i>If I can vanquish him,</i>
<i>my name will go down in history.</i>

11:28.060 --> 11:29.810
This is like laying siege on a castle.

11:29.890 --> 11:32.020
He will surely begin to starve
and fly out.

11:32.100 --> 11:33.650
That's what we wait for.

11:33.730 --> 11:36.270
If the reports are true, that is. However…

11:36.360 --> 11:37.360
-[soldier] What!
-[surprised grunt]

11:37.940 --> 11:40.360
Your Excellency!
Six shooters have been attacked!

11:40.440 --> 11:42.950
-What was that?
-[Peke] Patch them through.

11:43.030 --> 11:44.620
-[operator] Understood!
-[radio static]

11:45.200 --> 11:47.870
-This is Harghent. Report your situation.
-[♪ tense music playing]

11:48.450 --> 11:51.120
The six shooters below the cliff
are unaccounted for!

11:51.460 --> 11:52.620
The Smoldering one,

11:53.290 --> 11:56.000
he's probably crawling above ground
towards your location!

11:56.090 --> 11:57.880
C-Crawling on the ground?

11:58.460 --> 11:59.880
[Harghent] That prideful Vikeon is?

11:59.960 --> 12:02.050
-[Peke] Your Excellency, let's retreat.
-[Harghent grunts]

12:02.130 --> 12:04.800
-[loud bang]
-How could I make such a mistake?

12:04.890 --> 12:07.510
Your Excellency… We mustn't hesitate.

12:07.600 --> 12:08.760
He's heading right--

12:08.850 --> 12:09.890
-[whooshes]
-[surprised grunt]

12:09.970 --> 12:11.140
Why would he--

12:11.230 --> 12:12.520
[Peke] From Peke to Harghent.
[echoing]

12:12.600 --> 12:13.640
Setting Sun. Fly!

12:19.730 --> 12:22.110
[groaning]

12:22.820 --> 12:24.360
[Harghent] What the…

12:27.160 --> 12:28.830
[explosion]

12:28.910 --> 12:30.910
[fire roaring]

12:32.160 --> 12:33.160
What…

12:34.750 --> 12:36.790
-[loud stomp]
-[Harghent gasps]

12:36.880 --> 12:39.000
[♪ ominous music playing]

12:41.840 --> 12:44.010
[♪ dramatic music playing]

12:46.340 --> 12:47.890
[creature] You're the general,

12:48.550 --> 12:49.810
aren't you?

12:49.890 --> 12:51.310
[angry grunt]

12:51.390 --> 12:53.890
Curse you, Smoldering one!

12:54.890 --> 12:57.270
[creature] I'll allow you to answer.

12:57.350 --> 13:00.820
Are there any other hunting parties
out there?

13:01.530 --> 13:03.360
Do you fear the hand of a human slayer?

13:03.440 --> 13:04.820
Vikeon the Smoldering!

13:04.900 --> 13:07.200
Your spirit has fallen to the ground!

13:08.490 --> 13:09.700
Answer me.

13:10.330 --> 13:12.870
[Vikeon]
Is there anyone else besides yourselves?

13:14.160 --> 13:15.960
Choose not to answer,

13:16.460 --> 13:17.460
and I won't burn you,

13:18.080 --> 13:19.210
but torture you,

13:19.840 --> 13:20.960
then kill you.

13:21.050 --> 13:22.840
[Harghent] What happened…

13:23.550 --> 13:25.380
to your body?

13:25.840 --> 13:26.880
Smoldering one.

13:28.430 --> 13:31.220
You attempt to conceal your own disgrace

13:31.310 --> 13:34.230
but you inflict despicable
and humiliating acts against me?

13:36.850 --> 13:38.230
A champion…

13:38.810 --> 13:43.650
Have you ever seen a champion
with your own eyes, you weak minia?

13:43.730 --> 13:44.740
[Harghent] What?

13:45.320 --> 13:48.570
The strong one
that emerges from a huge group

13:48.660 --> 13:51.370
is what you lot call a champion, right?

13:51.950 --> 13:52.950
Surely not…

13:53.040 --> 13:55.750
Did a minian champion do this to you?

13:55.830 --> 13:57.670
-[Vikeon] Don't get arrogant!
-[rumbles]

13:57.750 --> 14:00.880
I've butchered so many minian champions
it's gotten boring.

14:00.960 --> 14:03.500
They were nothing more
than foolish snacks to me.

14:04.090 --> 14:06.090
I'll tell you the truth, minia.

14:07.590 --> 14:10.090
That champion who was favored by fate

14:11.100 --> 14:13.510
is also among the wyverns.

14:13.600 --> 14:14.600
[gasps]

14:15.470 --> 14:16.890
[Harghent] It was him…

14:17.270 --> 14:19.810
I told you of my humiliation.

14:19.900 --> 14:22.190
Now it's your turn to answer.

14:22.770 --> 14:23.770
[breathes shakily]

14:24.110 --> 14:26.690
I'm the last there is
of the hunting party.

14:27.190 --> 14:30.200
[Harghent]
No other Aureatia soldiers are coming.

14:31.200 --> 14:34.490
Very well,
I shall forgive you foolish minians,

14:34.580 --> 14:37.410
but in exchange,
you alone shall smolder in my flames.

14:38.910 --> 14:41.380
From Harghent to the iron of Aureatia.
[echoing]

14:41.460 --> 14:44.960
Approaching waves. Tower of shadows.
Swirling starry skies!

14:45.050 --> 14:46.710
[chain rattling]

14:48.170 --> 14:49.470
[Harghent] Nock an arrow!

14:50.680 --> 14:51.970
[thuds]

14:55.430 --> 14:58.560
The skies above me
shall fall into silence!

14:58.640 --> 15:02.650
Know the power
of Aureatia's Sixth General!

15:02.860 --> 15:03.860
[arrow fires]

15:06.440 --> 15:07.440
[exclaims in shock]

15:08.530 --> 15:12.160
[Vikeon] You're powerless.
Completely powerless.

15:13.700 --> 15:16.740
From Tileet…

15:17.830 --> 15:19.790
[♪ tense music playing]

15:22.330 --> 15:23.670
Why?

15:24.210 --> 15:25.790
[Harghent] Huh?
[gasps]

15:26.210 --> 15:27.880
[Vikeon] You again.

15:29.170 --> 15:30.380
Why?

15:31.880 --> 15:33.800
[Vikeon and Harghent] Star Runner!

15:33.890 --> 15:35.850
[♪ tense music playing]

15:43.400 --> 15:47.320
[narrator]
<i>He was born with three upper limbs.</i>

15:47.900 --> 15:50.440
<i>Those arms craved for something new.</i>

15:51.070 --> 15:53.950
<i>To grasp something yet unseen.</i>

15:54.530 --> 15:57.700
<i>He wanted to prove</i>
<i>that he was more than just a wyvern.</i>

15:58.290 --> 16:01.290
<i>He longed for everything</i>
<i>that was out of his reach.</i>

16:03.790 --> 16:05.960
<i>Before long, that desire led him</i>

16:06.040 --> 16:08.210
<i>to obtain a town's treasure.</i>

16:08.300 --> 16:10.210
<i>To conquer a land.</i>

16:10.300 --> 16:13.090
<i>To conquer a labyrinth.</i>

16:15.010 --> 16:20.100
<i>And now,</i>
<i>he's on the verge of destroying a legend.</i>

16:20.180 --> 16:22.270
A-Alus the Star Runner.

16:22.850 --> 16:25.190
[Vikeon] What more do you desire?

16:25.270 --> 16:28.190
You stole my entire fortune.

16:28.270 --> 16:30.280
Why take more?

16:31.740 --> 16:32.740
Why, you ask?

16:33.780 --> 16:36.280
[Alus] I'm simply doing what's natural.

16:38.240 --> 16:39.910
[Harghent] Star Runner!

16:39.990 --> 16:43.160
You stay out of this!

16:44.960 --> 16:46.040
[sighs]

16:48.750 --> 16:50.500
[Vikeon] Curse you, Star Runner.

16:51.260 --> 16:53.300
To the wind of Tileet.

16:53.380 --> 16:58.050
Dry up the hazy moon!

17:01.600 --> 17:03.930
[grunting, roaring]

17:07.940 --> 17:09.440
-[clicks]
-[♪ music fades]

17:12.480 --> 17:13.860
[♪ tense music continues playing]

17:13.940 --> 17:16.360
[screaming]

17:18.450 --> 17:20.370
[Vikeon groaning]

17:20.450 --> 17:21.700
[Alus] Poison magic bullets

17:21.790 --> 17:23.870
from the Arboreal Sky Spire
of the West Cliff.

17:23.950 --> 17:26.250
It explodes
when it makes contact with the nerves.

17:26.460 --> 17:27.580
[grunts]

17:27.670 --> 17:29.000
[growls]

17:29.080 --> 17:31.250
[Vikeon] To the wind of Tileet!

17:31.340 --> 17:32.550
From Alus to the pebble of Nimi.
[echoing]

17:32.630 --> 17:34.470
Flower returns to bud.
Split and break the shell…

17:34.550 --> 17:35.840
Dripping water.

17:35.920 --> 17:37.130
Pierce.

17:38.970 --> 17:40.890
[♪ tense music continues playing]

17:41.510 --> 17:43.310
[screaming]

17:43.390 --> 17:45.520
[Harghent]
<i>He performs shape-shifting Craft Arts</i>

17:45.600 --> 17:48.270
<i>far faster than even a single breath.</i>

17:48.350 --> 17:51.020
[screaming continues]

17:53.030 --> 17:54.400
[♪ music fades]

17:58.030 --> 17:59.200
[wings flapping]

18:02.700 --> 18:03.990
[pants]
Back off already!

18:04.580 --> 18:05.910
[Harghent] Don't you get it?

18:06.160 --> 18:07.580
He's my enemy!

18:08.330 --> 18:10.130
Why steal that from me?

18:10.210 --> 18:12.130
Are you attempting to help me?

18:13.960 --> 18:15.460
What an odd question.

18:16.470 --> 18:18.510
[Alus] One always helps a friend.

18:19.050 --> 18:20.300
Isn't that obvious?

18:21.010 --> 18:22.600
[Harghent grunts]
I…

18:23.100 --> 18:25.270
-I am not your friend.
-[♪ somber music playing]

18:25.350 --> 18:27.430
I am a general of Aureatia now.

18:28.100 --> 18:31.270
I'm a wyvern killer,
Harghent the Wing-Plucker!

18:32.190 --> 18:33.270
Is that right?

18:34.230 --> 18:35.900
[Harghent] To rise up in the world,

18:36.320 --> 18:39.150
I killed hundreds of your fellow kind.

18:39.990 --> 18:43.120
But I still want for glory,
even at this age.

18:44.120 --> 18:45.700
That's what led me here.

18:50.750 --> 18:54.290
[Alus] That's why I admire you, Harghent.

18:54.380 --> 18:55.670
[Harghent grunts]

18:56.260 --> 18:57.260
I heard about it.

18:57.340 --> 18:59.680
The Imperial Competition at Aureatia.

19:00.260 --> 19:02.550
Everyone's trying to put forth a Hero.

19:02.890 --> 19:03.930
That's right…

19:04.510 --> 19:05.890
I don't mind partaking.

19:07.350 --> 19:08.430
And like before--

19:08.520 --> 19:10.310
[Vikeon] To the wind of Tileet.

19:10.730 --> 19:12.560
Dry up…

19:12.650 --> 19:13.690
What!

19:13.770 --> 19:15.610
…the hazy moon!

19:16.110 --> 19:17.780
-Alus! Move--
-[explosion]

19:20.400 --> 19:23.070
-[ringing in ears]
-[rumbling]

19:29.750 --> 19:31.080
[gasps]

19:31.250 --> 19:33.330
[♪ soft music playing]

19:33.420 --> 19:36.460
-[Harghent] What is this?
-[Alus] The Greatshield of the Dead.

19:40.920 --> 19:42.470
[clinking]

19:46.430 --> 19:47.720
[Vikeon grunts]

19:47.930 --> 19:50.480
[shouting]
Star Runner!

19:51.390 --> 19:52.690
[Alus] One more.

19:54.190 --> 19:55.230
[Vikeon] To the wind--

19:55.310 --> 19:56.980
-[blade slashes]
-[♪ music stops]

20:03.700 --> 20:05.120
[loud thud]

20:09.040 --> 20:11.410
[Alus] Hillensingen the Luminous Blade.

20:14.830 --> 20:18.670
[Harghent] <i>He couldn't even move his arms</i>
<i>when I first met him.</i>

20:19.710 --> 20:20.710
<i>How did you…</i>

20:24.720 --> 20:27.850
The Twenty-Nine Officials of Aureatia
are searching for a Hero.

20:28.560 --> 20:31.640
They're gathering the strongest people
from around the world.

20:31.730 --> 20:32.730
[Alus] Yes.

20:33.310 --> 20:35.270
[Harghent]
If you're proud of your strength,

20:35.350 --> 20:37.230
you ought to come forward too.

20:40.820 --> 20:44.070
However… I won't choose you!

20:44.150 --> 20:45.610
I…

20:45.700 --> 20:50.370
I will never use your strength
to seize glory.

20:50.450 --> 20:51.450
I know.

20:52.330 --> 20:54.830
Your desire truly is radiant.

20:55.830 --> 20:57.460
One day,

20:58.040 --> 21:00.300
you're going to become
so much more than I am.

21:00.380 --> 21:01.510
[surprised grunt]

21:03.220 --> 21:05.180
[Harghent grunting]

21:07.090 --> 21:08.300
[Harghent] Where are you going?

21:09.140 --> 21:10.810
The Great Labyrinth of Nagan.

21:11.390 --> 21:13.140
Why go to a ruined city?

21:14.390 --> 21:16.060
There's something I want there.

21:26.030 --> 21:27.110
Alus…

21:30.530 --> 21:33.290
[narrator] <i>He is the one who can handle </i>

21:33.370 --> 21:36.500
<i>any kind of weapon there is</i>
<i>with exceptional aptitude.</i>

21:37.750 --> 21:40.790
<i>The one who possesses</i>
<i>many unusual magic items,</i>

21:40.880 --> 21:43.960
<i>collected from all over the land.</i>

21:44.590 --> 21:48.930
<i>The one who has challenged
numerous labyrinths and enemies</i>

21:49.010 --> 21:51.310
<i>throughout the vast world
and triumphed over them all.</i>

21:54.060 --> 21:57.890
<i>His desires even led him</i>
<i>to surpass dragons,</i>

21:57.980 --> 22:01.150
<i>making him the fastest airborne creature.</i>

22:06.450 --> 22:10.530
<i>He is a Rogue. He is a wyvern.</i>
<i>He is Alus the Star Runner.</i>

22:11.700 --> 22:13.910
[♪ closing theme music playing]

23:43.710 --> 23:44.750
Next: Episode 3
Dakai the Magpie

23:44.840 --> 23:45.840
and Regnejee the Wings of Sunset

23:45.920 --> 23:46.920
Translated by Zacarias Hicks
